# REQUIRES: verilator
# `--lane-scan` over port bundles (Driver/Inputs/lane-bundle): array elements
# of one lane's ports are the lane's; a suffix chain (lane j reads lane j + 1:
# the lanes probed in both orders, the reversed one taken); `p & -p` as a
# carry chain with a carry of 1; a buffer register of {onehot, index, tag}
# split at the onehot's ends, the onehot per-lane state in the cell. Exact
# against the target, channels stalled or not, and with the cell in two
# copies, bubbles and chain cuts.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/lane-bundle
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/zl --static --nest --modulo --compact-links --zero-latency-links --zero-latency-chains --lane-scan Leaf 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SCAN
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/zl/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/zl/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/zl/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/zl/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+1 +stall=0 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/zl/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+2 +stall=40 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/cp --static --nest --modulo --compact-links --bubbles --share-links --zero-latency-links --zero-latency-chains --zero-chain-hops 2 --copies Top_lane_Leaf_r:2 --lane-scan Leaf 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SCAN
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/cp/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/cp/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/cp/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/cp/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+3 +stall=0 +bubble=0 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/cp/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+4 +stall=40 +bubble=30 | FileCheck %s

# SCAN: lane-scan: cell Top_lane_Leaf_r
# SCAN: lane-scan: Top lanes Leaf_r x8: {{.*}} lane vectors; scans {{.*}}carry 1 {{.*}}stage 1

# CHECK: MATCH
